        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pwvBuZZOsnlDVYhLp-rC-31" parent="1" style="html=1;overflow=block;blockSpacing=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;spacing=9;strokeOpacity=100;fillOpacity=100;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=9;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=1.5;lucidId=Ajw0Ht6sMbPM;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; justify-content: center; text-align: center; align-items: baseline; font-size: 0; line-height: 1.25;margin-top: -2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.7px;color:#000000;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;H2H&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.7px;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;                                                                                                                                        &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Apa itu:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;&quot;&gt; Sistem koneksi langsung (berbasis API/SFTP) antara &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;server&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;&quot;&gt; internal perusahaan kita dengan &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;server&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;&quot;&gt; Bank Mandiri.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20px;&quot;&gt; &#xa;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; text-align: left; align-items: baseline; font-size: 0; line-height: 1.25;margin-top: -2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Cara kerja:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;&quot;&gt; Tim Finance tidak lagi harus buka &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;browser&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;login&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;&quot;&gt; ke portal bank (misal: Mandiri Kopra/MCM), masukin token/OTP, dan &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;upload file&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;&quot;&gt; Excel untuk transfer uang.                                                                                                     H2H membuat sistem web &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&quot;komunikasi langsung&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;&quot;&gt; dengan bank. Saat ada &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;approval&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;&quot;&gt; pencairan dana di web , web akan otomatis mengirim instruksi (via API) ke bank untuk mencairkan dana detik itu juga, dan bank akan mengirimkan status sukses/gagal kembali ke web kita.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="231" width="714" x="6384" y="-445" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pwvBuZZOsnlDVYhLp-rC-32" parent="1" style="html=1;overflow=block;blockSpacing=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;spacing=9;strokeOpacity=100;fillOpacity=100;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=9;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=1.5;lucidId=Plw0_h_XXotd;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; justify-content: center; text-align: center; align-items: baseline; font-size: 0; line-height: 1.25;margin-top: -2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.7px;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;MSA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.7px;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;                                                                                                                                        &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Apa itu:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;&quot;&gt; Produk manajemen kas dari Bank Mandiri. Perusahaan hanya punya &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;1 Rekening Giro Utama (Induk)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;&quot;&gt;, tapi bisa menerbitkan banyak kartu fisik (ATM/EDC) atau &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;virtual account&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;&quot;&gt; (Anak) untuk setiap area.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20px;&quot;&gt;                                                                       &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Cara kerja:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;&quot;&gt; Dana operasional terpusat di Rekening Induk. Melalui web kita (yang sudah H2H dengan Bank), kita bisa mengatur &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;limit/plafon&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;&quot;&gt; untuk setiap kartu ATM/EDC cabang.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20px;&quot;&gt; &#xa;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; text-align: left; align-items: baseline; font-size: 0; line-height: 1.25;margin-top: -2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;Contoh:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;&quot;&gt; Cabang Bandung di-set limit Rp10 juta. Saat kasir Bandung tarik tunai di ATM, uangnya dipotong langsung dari Rekening Induk perusahaan, tapi dibatasi maksimal Rp10 juta. Finance pusat tidak perlu repot transfer uang ke rekening masing-masing area. Jika limit habis dan butuh dana (Kas Kecil Web OFR), sistem &quot;Parking&quot; akan menahan &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;request&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.3px;&quot;&gt; sampai dana/limit ditambahkan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="285" width="714" x="7135" y="-472" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
